[I] Spice guest agent for Linux

[T] spice-vdagent is the SPICE agent for Linux guests, consisting of the
[T] system daemon spice-vdagentd and a per X-session agent process. It
[T] provides features such as client mouse mode, copy and paste between
[T] client and guest, automatic display resolution adjustment and file
[T] transfer.

[U] https://spice-space.org/

[A] Spice-vdagent Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

